msgid "Added chat folders: organize your chats into folders"
msgstr "Se han añadido carpetas de chats: organiza tus chats en carpetas"

#: data/io.github.qwersyk.Newelle.appdata.xml.in:213
msgid "Added commands: extensions can now add commands to Newelle"
